  "skipped_rationale": "v3.0 only models residential (home) and workplace (work) plug-in behavior. Multi-unit-dwelling (mud) is conflated into residential via NHTS housing-type weights (separate concern, not via this dataset). Public/other charging is v3.2+ scope.",
  "missing_groups_note": "Not all (segment, day_type, group_id) combos exist in the dataset \u2014 some driver groups never charge at a segment. JSON consumer must skip absent group_ids and reweight P(G) over present groups when sampling the marginal for that segment."
